+    rows, with B12X's SIMT projection arithmetic (module docstring). ``epilogue``:
+    ``none``; ``bias`` (``Bias[N]``); ``gelu`` (the bias, then GELU); ``swiglu``
+    (``W`` stacks the gate's and the up's ``N / 2`` rows; ``C`` is ``N / 2`` wide)."""
